{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meow meow meow!</strong><br>What if cats could talk? How would they communicate with humans?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Paw to Talk</i>, you play as a clever little kitty who uses talking buttons to express thoughts, interact with humans, complete fun objectives, and unlock heartwarming (and sometimes hilarious) stories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But wait...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why does Kitty want to learn to talk in the first place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is it for snacks?<br>To solve human troubles?<br>Or simply to say \u201cI love you\u201d out loud?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the magical <i>Ticket Meow-chine</i>, where you can collect special stubs to enter a variety of whimsical scenes\u2014each one a new chapter in Kitty\u2019s button-talking adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/catbtn_store_eng_01.gif?t=1745932217\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/catbtn_store_screen_09.gif?t=1745932217\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn into a <strong>Treat Machine</strong>, furiously pressing buttons to get all the snacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/catbtn_store_eng_02.gif?t=1745932217\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/catbtn_store_screen_01.gif?t=1745932217\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become a <strong>DJ Kitty</strong>, lighting up the night with your paws on the decks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/catbtn_store_eng_03.gif?t=1745932217\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/catbtn_store_screen_02.gif?t=1745932217\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your Kitty with different fur colors and patterns\u2014make it the feline of your dreams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/catbtn_store_08.png?t=1745932217\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plus, enjoy fun mini-games like <strong>Whack-a-Tentacle</strong> and more surprises waiting for your paws!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3622660?t=1745932217","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3622660?t=1745932217","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/1c0591fe84a43f953de14c70d69303599d1395ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745932217","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/1c0591fe84a43f953de14c70d69303599d1395ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745932217","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meow meow meow!</strong><br>What if cats could talk? How would they communicate with humans?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Paw to Talk</i>, you play as a clever little kitty who uses talking buttons to express thoughts, interact with humans, complete fun objectives, and unlock heartwarming (and sometimes hilarious) stories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But wait...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why does Kitty want to learn to talk in the first place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is it for snacks?<br>To solve human troubles?<br>Or simply to say \u201cI love you\u201d out loud?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the magical <i>Ticket Meow-chine</i>, where you can collect special stubs to enter a variety of whimsical scenes\u2014each one a new chapter in Kitty\u2019s button-talking adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/catbtn_store_eng_01.gif?t=1745932217\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/catbtn_store_screen_09.gif?t=1745932217\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn into a <strong>Treat Machine</strong>, furiously pressing buttons to get all the snacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/catbtn_store_eng_02.gif?t=1745932217\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/catbtn_store_screen_01.gif?t=1745932217\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become a <strong>DJ Kitty</strong>, lighting up the night with your paws on the decks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/catbtn_store_eng_03.gif?t=1745932217\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/catbtn_store_screen_02.gif?t=1745932217\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your Kitty with different fur colors and patterns\u2014make it the feline of your dreams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/catbtn_store_08.png?t=1745932217\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plus, enjoy fun mini-games like <strong>Whack-a-Tentacle</strong> and more surprises waiting for your paws!</p>","developers":["JUNIOR.